  "fullDescription": "Fall Stamps set has 16 unique stamps and 1 pattern brush. These stamps are hand drawn and can be imported directly into Procreate for digital design, art, and crafting for personal or professional use in illustrations, design, scrapbooking, crafting, print on demand, and more.\n\nThis set includes: 1 Pattern Brush, 4 Leaf Stamps, 1 Berry, 1 Acorn, 2 Pumpkins, 2 Bumble Bees, 2 Sunflowers, 1 Tree, 1 Boot, 1 Pumpkin and Squash, and 1 Mushroom.\n\nThese stamps can be resized and moved as needed within the Procreate file. The stamps are opaque, so you can use whatever color or overlay you so choose!\n\nThis set is ONLY compatible with Procreate and can be used on an iPad with an Apple Pencil. The downloaded file can be imported directly into Procreate and are ready to us.",
